reason = "WORLD-35: the base-kit step from lake_high_wall's floor passage back up onto the causeway, the way west with no song (lake_shore header), on the way from the lake through lake_chasm into the Orchards (systems/world); since step 4 the song union also links orchard_chasm_bridge to orchard_mill_town through orchard_summit and the counterweights, so its greedy pass needs this step or the east bank's (37,5), never both; the two are parallel ways, and the kit check (room_kit_test) holds every kit's way back"

